<title>HONG KONG: Best Wide posts HK$1.54 mln interim loss.</title>
<headline>Best Wide posts HK$1.54 mln interim loss.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   0.45 loss vs 5.94 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	 vs 12.32 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    1.54 loss vs 12.66 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     52.14     vs 14.56</p>
<p>    Company name		 Best Wide Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Best Wide Group, formerly called Yukon Holdings Ltd, engages in overseas garment manufacturing and real estate investment and development.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
